<body lang="ru-RU" link="#000080" vlink="#800000" dir="ltr"><p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm">
1 шаг) открыть консоль через <span lang="en-US">C</span><span lang="en-US">trl
+ </span><span lang="en-US">A</span><span lang="en-US">lt + T</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><br/>

</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><img src="%D0%A4%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BB%20HTML%E2%80%A6_docx_c614e9c.png" name="Image1 Copy 1" align="left" width="643" height="217" border="0"/>
<br/>

</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><br/>

</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span lang="en-US">2
</span><span lang="ru-RU">шаг) водим</span><span lang="en-US">
vi scriptn.sh </span>
</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><br/>

</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><img src="%D0%A4%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BB%20HTML%E2%80%A6_docx_e8e6f999.png" name="Image2" align="left" width="643" height="102" border="0"/>
<br/>

</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><br/>

</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span lang="en-US">3
шаг</span><span lang="ru-RU">)  водим:</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span lang="ru-RU">1
строка</span><span lang="en-US">: </span><span lang="en-US">#!/bin/bash
</span>
</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span lang="en-US">2
</span><span lang="ru-RU">строка</span><span lang="en-US">:</span><span lang="ru-RU">
</span><span lang="en-US">user=$(whoami)</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span lang="en-US">3
</span><span lang="ru-RU">строка</span><span lang="en-US">:</span><span lang="ru-RU">
</span><span lang="en-US">echo “</span><span lang="ru-RU">Пользователь:
</span><span lang="en-US">$user”</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span lang="en-US">4
</span><span lang="ru-RU">строка</span><span lang="en-US">:</span><span lang="ru-RU">
</span><span lang="en-US">ps -u $user</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span lang="en-US">5
</span><span lang="ru-RU">строка</span><span lang="en-US">:</span><span lang="ru-RU">
</span><span lang="en-US">echo “</span><span lang="ru-RU">Всего:
</span><span lang="en-US">$(ps -u $user –no-headers | wc -l)”</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><br/>

</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><br/>

</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><img src="%D0%A4%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BB%20HTML%E2%80%A6_docx_28032b05.png" name="Image3" align="left" width="643" height="225" border="0"/>
<br/>

</p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span lang="en-US">4
</span><span lang="ru-RU">шаг)  </span><span lang="ru-RU">выходим
нажатием клавиш </span><span lang="en-US">I </span><span lang="ru-RU">после
</span><span lang="en-US">Esc </span><span lang="ru-RU">вводим
:</span><span lang="en-US">wq </span><span lang="ru-RU">после
</span><span lang="en-US">Enter</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span lang="ru-RU">5
шаг) делаем скрипт исполняемым, вводим:
</span><span lang="en-US">chmod +x scriptn.sh , </span><span lang="ru-RU">вывод
в файл</span><font color="#000000"><font face="Nimbus Roman"><font size="3" style="font-size: 12pt"><span lang="en-US"><span style="background: #ffffff">./scriptn.sh
[</span></span></font></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="Nimbus Roman"><font size="3" style="font-size: 12pt"><span lang="ru-RU"><span style="background: #ffffff">аргументы</span></span></font></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="Nimbus Roman"><font size="3" style="font-size: 12pt"><span lang="en-US"><span style="background: #ffffff">]
&gt; resaultn.txt , проверка содержимого файла
cat resultn.txt</span></span></font></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="monospace"><font size="3" style="font-size: 12pt"><span lang="en-US"><span style="background: #ffffff"><br/>
</span></span></font></font></font><br/>

</p>
